OL,3,GNEWSARingo Starr's granddaughter
OL,4,Alaunches exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe granddaughter of The Beatles
OL,7,Fdrummer Ringo Starr is putting on an
OL,8,Fart exhibition in Surrey.
OL,10,FTatia Starkey told BBC Radio Surrey she
OL,11,Fwanted to communicate whatever was
OL,12,Finside herself to "expel it".
OL,14,F"I'm just trying to share with people
OL,15,Fthe feeling of love, the lack of love,
OL,16,Fdifferent expressions that we have and
OL,17,Fthe very high points in life," she
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,FThe collection, titled Invert, sees
OL,21,FStarkey use her body to paint canvases.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
